---
import Site from '../../layouts/Site.astro';
---

<Site
	title="Alt-Meat: Launching a Brand and Platform in Under 8 Weeks · Steven Vanden Heuvel"
	description="As Creative Director at MTG, I built the brand, magazine, enewsletters, and responsive news site for Alt-Meat as one system, in under 8 weeks, aimed at the growing alternative protein market."
	image="/og/alt-meat.png"
>
	<section class="cs-hero">
		<div class="cs-hero__inner">
			<a class="cs-back-top" href="/#work">← Case studies</a>
			<p class="eyebrow">Case study</p>
			<h1 class="cs-hero__title display">Alt-Meat: Launching a Brand and Platform in Under 8 Weeks</h1>
			<p class="cs-hero__lede">MTG was entering the alternative protein market and needed a credible brand and publication before the moment passed.</p>
			<dl class="cs-meta">
				<div><dt>Role</dt><dd>Creative Director</dd></div>
				<div><dt>Org</dt><dd>MTG Media Group</dd></div>
				<div><dt>Recognition</dt><dd>Launched in under 8 weeks</dd></div>
			</dl>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section--alt section--figure">
		<div class="section__inner">
			<div class="cs-figure" data-animate="fade">
				<img class="theme-img theme-img--dark" src="/images/case-studies/alt-meat/alt-meat-hero.jpg" alt="Alt-Meat site and editorial across devices" />
				<img class="theme-img theme-img--light" src="/images/case-studies/alt-meat/alt-meat-hero-light.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section">
		<div class="section__inner cs-body" data-animate="fade">
			<div class="cs-block">
				<p class="eyebrow">What was unclear</p>
				<p class="cs-block__lede">A new market, and a short window to be credible in it.</p>
				<p>MTG was entering the alternative protein market, the growing non-animal protein space, and needed a credible brand and publication before the moment passed.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section--alt">
		<div class="section__inner cs-body" data-animate="fade">
			<div class="cs-block">
				<p class="eyebrow">What I led</p>
				<p class="cs-block__lede">Brand, magazine, enewsletters, and site as one system, in under 8 weeks.</p>
				<p>I built the brand identity, the magazine, the enewsletters, and a responsive news site as one system, in under 8 weeks. The visual language tied them together so the new title read as a peer to MTG's other properties.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section">
		<div class="section__inner cs-body" data-animate="fade">
			<div class="cs-block">
				<p class="eyebrow">Who I influenced</p>
				<p class="cs-block__lede">Brand and product design, across the business.</p>
				<p>I led brand and product design, working with the owner and president, the Publisher, the editor, and the developers.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section--alt">
		<div class="section__inner cs-body" data-animate="fade">
			<div class="cs-block">
				<p class="eyebrow">What changed</p>
				<p class="cs-block__lede">MTG launched a new property on a tight timeline, aimed at a growing audience.</p>
			</div>
			<ul class="cs-awards">
				<li><span class="cs-awards__mark">★</span><span>Brand, magazine, enewsletters, and responsive site shipped together</span></li>
				<li><span class="cs-awards__mark">★</span><span>Built in under 8 weeks, from a standing start</span></li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section">
		<div class="section__inner cs-body" data-animate="fade">
			<div class="cs-block">
				<p class="eyebrow">Design system</p>
				<p class="cs-block__lede">The component library behind this build is still browsable.</p>
				<p>The original Pattern Lab from the project, and the same patterns rebuilt in Storybook with interactive controls on the core atoms.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="cs-artifacts">
				<a class="btn" href="/labs/altmeat/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open the Pattern Lab</a>
				<a class="btn" href="/labs/altmeat-storybook/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open the Storybook</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section--alt">
		<div class="section__inner cs-back">
			<a class="btn" href="/work/blackbird">← Project Blackbird</a>
			<a class="btn btn--primary" href="/work/meatingplace">Next: Meatingplace →</a>
		</div>
	</section>
</Site>

<style>
	.cs-hero { max-width: var(--max); margin: 0 auto; padding: var(--space-2xl) var(--gutter); }
	.cs-back-top { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: var(--space-lg); color: var(--text-mute); font-size: var(--text-body-sm); }
	.cs-back-top:hover { color: var(--lime); }
	.cs-hero__title { margin: var(--space-xs) 0 var(--space-lg); max-width: 20ch; }
	.cs-hero__lede { font-size: var(--text-deck); color: var(--text); line-height: 1.5; max-width: 56ch; margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl); font-weight: 500; }
	.cs-meta { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: var(--space-md); margin: 0; padding: var(--space-lg) 0 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
	.cs-meta div { margin: 0; }
	.cs-meta dt { font-size: var(--text-label); letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-mute); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs); }
	.cs-meta dd { margin: 0; color: var(--text); font-size: var(--text-body); font-weight: 500; }

	.cs-figure { max-width: 75%; margin: 0 auto; }
	.cs-figure img { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }

	.cs-body { display: grid; gap: var(--space-2xl); max-width: var(--max-narrow); }
	/* Hierarchy: eyebrow + subhead group as the headline, body is support. */
	.cs-block .eyebrow { margin-bottom: var(--space-xs); }
	/* case-study eyebrows: nickel, normal weight, .03em, black */
	.eyebrow { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 400; font-variation-settings: "wght" 400, "slnt" 0, "ital" 0; font-synthesis: none; letter-spacing: 0.03em; }
	.cs-block__lede { color: var(--text); font-size: clamp(24px, 2.5vw, 32px); font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 var(--space-lg); letter-spacing: -0.015em; line-height: 1.25; }
	.cs-block p { color: #5A6565; margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; }
	.cs-block p + p { margin-top: var(--space-sm); }

	.cs-awards { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 0; }
	.cs-awards li { display: flex; gap: var(--space-md); align-items: center; padding: var(--space-md) 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); font-size: 18px; }
	.cs-awards li:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
	.cs-awards__mark { display: none; }

	.cs-artifacts { display: flex; gap: var(--space-sm); flex-wrap: wrap; }

	.cs-back { display: flex; gap: var(--space-sm); flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
	.cs-back .btn--primary { background: var(--text); color: var(--bg); border-color: var(--text); }
	.cs-back .btn--primary:hover { background: var(--text); border-color: var(--text); color: var(--bg); box-shadow: none; }

	@media (max-width: 880px) {
		.section--figure { padding: 0 24px; }
		.cs-figure { max-width: 100%; }
		.cs-hero__title { font-size: clamp(32px, 9vw, 56px); }
	}
	@media (max-width: 700px) {
		.cs-meta { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
	}
</style>
